          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_introduces_moccasin_new_constraint_p",
          "text": "This paper introduces Moccasin, a new constraint programming formulation for the problem of minimizing execution time under a memory budget.",
