          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_unlike_prior_work_needs_quadratic",
          "text": "Unlike prior work that needs a quadratic number of Boolean variables, Moccasin uses only a linear number of integer variables, letting it scale to much larger compute graphs and run up to an order of magnitude faster.",
