          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_core_problem_scheduling_one_given",
          "text": "So the core problem is a scheduling one: for a given compute graph and a fixed memory budget, decide which tensors to retain and which to recompute so that total execution time is as small as possible while peak memory never exceeds the budget.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
