          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_quadratic_growth_becomes_wall_graphs",
          "text": "That quadratic growth becomes a wall: for graphs with a few hundred nodes and a few thousand edges, Checkmate either times out or runs out of memory during the solve.",
