          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_because_trend_toward_on_device_stric",
          "text": "Because the trend toward on-device training and stricter latency targets keeps enlarging these graphs, we need a formulation whose complexity grows much more slowly, so realistic graphs can be solved within an acceptable compile time.",
