        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_top_authors_show_how_encode",
          "text": "On top of this, the authors show how to encode the nonlinear memory and precedence constraints using standard CP building blocks, the cumulative and reservoir constraints, and they add an optional variant that enforces an input topological ordering to further reduce the search space.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "top",
            "authors",
            "show",
            "how",
            "encode",
            "nonlinear",
            "memory",
            "precedence",
            "constraints",
